ld. He wanted to be involved in it.&#34; <BR> <BR>Lawson recalled that even though the family had been in Wichita since November, a moving van had brought a load of furniture to the Otero home only about two days ago. <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR>I wonder if there are other elementary schools just next to all the other victimes? could somone else check this out? Did this principal work at other schools? <BR> <BR>Where did Shirly Vians 8 year old son go to school? <BR> <BR>Did any of the other victims do any volantary work at any schools? or had other connctions to schools where this person might have worked? <BR> <BR>Here is a map with all the elemntary schools in wichita: <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.usd259.com/maps/elementaryschools.html" target=_top>http://www.usd259.com/maps/elementaryschools.html</a> <BR> <BR>Did the pricipal have the tuesday and thursday late morning off &#40;all the killings was tuesdays and thursdays&#41;? meeting at work at 11 or 12 am thise two days? <BR> <BR>I have tried to find out more about the principal on the net but had no luck. Does anyone have acces to payed backgrond checks regaring where a person lived 30 years back? and also criminal records? If so please check this person up ? and post it on this thred. <BR> <BR>I am probably way off with this but who knows? Let me know what you think? <BR> <BR>skov <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
